WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.670
Hi, I'm Nikema Prophet.

00:00:01.670 --> 00:00:04.630
I'm a developer advocate
who builds things.

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:10.180
I was a developer advocate at PayPal
then an engineer on developer.paypal.com.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:15.820
Before that, I ran community content at
Armory and co-led contributor experience

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:17.220
for Spinnaker.

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:19.820
Right now I'm building Impossible Hires.

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:25.120
It's an opt-in talent network for people
whose work doesn't fit one job title.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:29.840
The people who build the demo, write the
docs and notice where users get stuck.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.600
I've built it in public
one piece at a time.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:37.480
First the interest forms, then private
profile sharing where nobody's profile

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:41.720
goes to an employer until that person
approves the exact version being sent.

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:44.000
Then a fictional demo that anyone can try,

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.740
including an MCP server so
AI agents can search it too.

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:52.020
The biggest lesson so far, when I couldn't
explain consent-based introductions

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:56.690
with copy, an interactive demo with
made-up profiles did it for me.

00:00:56.690 --> 00:01:00.080
I'm showing what's working and being
honest about what isn't done yet.

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:04.030
I'm looking for a developer advocate
role at a company that builds developer

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:06.420
tools, APIs or AI tooling.

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:08.940
If you want an advocate
who ships real demos,

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:13.160
writes clear and accessible docs and
brings what developers say back to the

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:15.420
product team, let's talk.

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:20.150
I'd prefer remote, I'm based in Sacramento
and I'd move to the Bay Area for the

00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:20.940
right role.

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:21.820
Let's chat.

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:24.230
You can find my booking link on this page.
